  "description": "First floor side extension; first floor rear extension with Juliette balconies; external alterations",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be begun before\r\nthe expiration of three years from the date of this permission.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby permitted, shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and supporting documents:&amp;nbsp; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Site Location Plan, Existing Floor and Elevations Plan entitled Drawing No: RSD2332 - 02;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Floor and Elevations Plan entitled Drawing No: RSD2332 – 300 Rev A;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Flood Risk Assessment entitled RSD2332 received July 10th, 2024;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reasonable Exception Statement received October 21st, 2025;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
    "The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (or any order revoking and re-enacting that order with or without modification), no further window(s)/door(s) shall be installed in the flank elevation(s) of the development hereby permitted without the prior permission in writing of the local planning authority.",
    "The flat-roofed areas serving the existing single storey side/rear extensions shall not be used as a balcony, roof garden or similar amenity area without the grant of further specific permission from the Local Planning Authority."
